@startuml seq-uc1-login
title UC1 Log in: sequence (success path)

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
autonumber

actor User
participant "LoginView" as View
participant "LoginController" as Controller
participant "LoginInteractor\n<<LoginInputBoundary>>" as Interactor
participant "FileUserDataAccessObject\n<<LoginUserDataAccessInterface>>" as DAO
participant "LoginPresenter\n<<LoginOutputBoundary>>" as Presenter
participant "LoginViewModel" as VM
participant "ViewManagerModel" as VMM

User -> View : enters email and password, logs in
View -> Controller : execute(email, password)
Controller -> Interactor : execute(new LoginInputData(email, password))
Interactor -> DAO : getByEmail(email)
DAO --> Interactor : User
Interactor -> Interactor : compare the password hash
Interactor -> DAO : setCurrentUserId(id)
Interactor -> Presenter : prepareSuccessView(\nnew LoginOutputData(username, id, role))
Presenter -> VM : clear the login form
Presenter -> VMM : setActiveView(Manage Pets for an admin,\notherwise the gallery)
VMM --> User : shows the home screen for the role

note over Interactor, Presenter
  Empty fields, an unknown email or a wrong password:
  the interactor calls prepareFailView(message)
  and the login form shows the error.
end note

@enduml
